Google Workspace CLI — one command-line tool for Drive, Gmail, Calendar,
Sheets, Docs, Chat, Admin, and more. Dynamically built from Google Discovery
Service.

gws doesn't ship a static list of commands. It reads Google's own Discovery
Service at runtime and builds its entire command surface dynamically. When
Google Workspace adds an API endpoint or method, gws picks it up
automatically.

Using it requires a Google account and a Google Cloud project with OAuth
credentials. The gws auth setup command can create these using gcloud from
net/google-cloud-sdk.

This is not an officially supported Google product.
